        "r": 307.91700000000003,
        "b": 694.7187304760582
      },
      "content": "Disconnect/isolate the appliance from the power supply.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_641",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
